    {
      "id": "S6",
      "obj_id": "S-6",
      "kind": "setup",
      "provenance": "from-note",
      "nl": {
        "statement": "The bounded statistical subclass and the generated-rank frontier. Fix a smoothness index \\(\\beta\\in(2,\\infty)\\), a lower-envelope constant \\(c\\in(0,1)\\), a uniform regularity constant \\(M\\in(1,\\infty)\\), an interior margin \\(\\rho\\in(0,1/2)\\), and a compact evaluation domain \\(K\\subseteq\\operatorname{int}(\\mathcal X)\\). Write \\(\\mathcal Z_i(K)=\\{L_{B_i}(x):x\\in K\\}\\) and let \\(g_i\\) be the density of \\(L_{B_i}(X)\\) under \\(P^i\\), with \\(g_i\\equiv1\\) when \\(B_i=\\varnothing\\). The bounded Holder subclass \\(\\Theta^\\beta_{G,s}(c,M,K,\\rho)\\subseteq\\Theta_{G,s}\\) collects the mechanisms obeying a bounded Holder radius, a density lower envelope, an own-derivative margin, a common interior domain, bounded shared mixing geometry, observed log-ratio regularity, and a conditional design envelope. With \\(d_\\star=\\max_{i\\in[n]}|B_i|\\), a first-stage rate \\(b_N\\downarrow0\\) and failure sequence \\(\\eta_N\\downarrow0\\), and a bandwidth \\(h_N\\downarrow0\\), the simultaneous first-stage event is \\(\\mathcal E_N^\\infty(b_N)=\\{\\max_{i\\in[n]}\\|\\log\\widehat R_i-\\log R_i\\|_{C^1(\\mathcal X)}\\le b_N\\}\\) and the target coordinate rate is \\(r_N=h_N^2+\\sqrt{\\log(\\underline N)/(\\underline N h_N^{d_\\star})}+b_N/h_N\\). In this world \\(\\widehat U_i\\) denotes a second-stage cross-fitted conditional-CDF estimator of \\(U_i\\) and \\(\\mathfrak H_{\\mathrm{rank}}\\) the local-linear conditional-CDF and generated-covariate linearization handle; neither is given a determinate construction here. — All of \\(\\beta,c,M,\\rho,K,\\mathcal Z_i(K),g_i,d_\\star,b_N,\\eta_N,h_N,\\mathcal E_N^\\infty,\\Theta^\\beta,r_N\\) are determinate and are defined formally. Per decision P-D2, \\(\\mathfrak H_{\\mathrm{rank}}\\) and \\(\\widehat U_i\\) are NOT given Lean constructions: the core marks \\(\\widehat U_i\\) an `open statistical construction` and \\(\\mathfrak H_{\\mathrm{rank}}\\) an `open-question handle`, and the frozen OEQ text says the handle does not yet provide a second-stage weight convention. They are bound here as named narrative symbols recorded inside the descriptive `String` payloads of `def:generated-rank-handle` and `oeq:generated-rank-frontier`. Search trace: grep `local linear|localLinear|conditional CDF|conditionalCdf|generated covariate|generatedRegressor` over ../Causalean → no local-linear conditional-CDF estimator; API.md §12ep (Glivenko-Cantelli), §12' (concentration), §13'''' (OrthogonalLearning) read — uniform-deviation and critical-radius machinery exists but no local-polynomial conditional-distribution estimator; Mathlib side lean_leansearch `local linear regression conditional distribution estimator` → nothing. This is why the note leaves the construction open rather than why the plan defers it.",
