        "tex_anchor": "",
        "frozen": true,
        "frozen_body": "For every \\(i\\in[n]\\), the observational mechanism \\(p_i\\) and the intervention density \\(q_i\\) are strictly positive, normalized \\(C^3\\) densities on their respective closed cubes.",
