  "convergenceReview": {
    "prop:sparse-witness-certificate": {
      "codex": {
        "verdict": "matched",
        "evidence_hash": "f9912cd1cdc2c2ec6a82734a5d6be73d119d2976",
        "note": "After unfolding the witness mechanisms, canonical laws, ratio-law pushforwards, Gaussian feature map, MMD, regularity, sign, and faithfulness predicates, Lean states every paper clause with the same graph, environments, ratio coordinate, strict constants, and equality of the full cancellation ratio laws."
      },
      "claude": {
        "verdict": "matched",
        "evidence_hash": "f9912cd1cdc2c2ec6a82734a5d6be73d119d2976",
        "note": "Both directions check out for every s : SignVector 3 with no extra hypotheses: PositiveNormalizedSmoothMechanisms (positivity of p_i/q_i on the closed cube, C³, per-coordinate normalization) + the ∀k ContDiffOn conjuncts give the paper's 'positive, normalized, C^∞'; Faithfulness threeNodeDAG (threeNodeEdge = 0→1 with node 2 isolated) is exactly 'faithful to 1→2 plus isolated node 3'; FixedOwnDerivativeSign G s θ (0 < s_i · ∂ own log-ratio on the cube) with sparseP/cancellationP/sparseQ built through reflect σ z = if σ=1 then z else 1-z is the 'prescribed derivative signs after reflection'; indices line up 0-based (Ws.ratio 1 = R_2, Ws.law 0 = P^0, Ws.law (Fin.succ 0) = interventionalLaw on node 0 = P^1, populationDiscrepancy _ Ws 0 1 = D_{12} with j=0,i=1), so 3/10000 < ∫R_2²dP^0 − ∫R_2²dP^1 and 5/100000000 < D_12 are literally the paper's 3×10⁻⁴ and 5×10⁻⁸ bounds, and observationalRatioLaw Wc 1 = interventionalRatioLaw Wc 0 1 plus populationDiscrepancy … = 0 is 'the entire direct-edge ratio law is identical in environments 0 and 1, so D_12 = 0'. Only observation: `k : WithTop ℕ∞` so `∀ k, ContDiffOn ℝ k` also covers k = ω (real-analyticity), formally a shade beyond 'C^∞', but it is a provable strengthening about these fixed exponential/polynomial witnesses (Lean ⟹ paper, and the paper conjunct is itself provable for them), so the two propositions are provably equivalent on the stated domain — not an over-advertisement in the paper direction."
      }
    },
    "thm:generic-cover-separation": {
      "codex": {
        "verdict": "matched",
        "evidence_hash": "18ec73510821d001b802248486d3dafece575547",
        "note": "The nonemptiness premise is equivalent to Θ_{G,s} ≠ ∅; openness, density, residuality via meagre complement, closed nowhere-dense complement, and the edge-free equalities match exactly, while the extra V ⊆ U conjunct follows unconditionally from the unfolded separation definitions."
      },
      "claude": {
        "verdict": "matched",
        "evidence_hash": "18ec73510821d001b802248486d3dafece575547",
        "note": "Lean ⟺ core node: hne = Θ_{G,s}≠∅; edgeSeparatedSet/coverSeparatedSet unfold (Helpers/Kernel.lean:167,175) exactly to V={θ:F_{π⁻¹j,π⁻¹i}≠0 ∀ edge j→i} and U={θ:D_{ji}>0 whenever π(j)⋖_G π(i)} (ancestralCover = CovBy for DAG.isAncestor, D = ‖Δ mean embeddings‖ of the Gaussian kernel exp(-(a-b)²) via gaussianFeatureMap, secondMomentContrast = E_{P^j}R_i²−E_{P^0}R_i²), over StratumPoint = subtype of ModelStratum (positive-normalized-smooth ∧ causal-minimality ∧ fixed-sign) with the induced product C² topology; IsOpen/Dense for V, IsOpen/Dense for U, IsMeagre Uᶜ = residual, IsClosed ∧ IsNowhereDense Uᶜ, and (∀ j i, ¬G.edge j i) → V=U=univ render the empty-graph clause. The one extra conjunct V ⊆ U is not an overclaim: it is established verbatim in the frozen node's own proof_tex (\"We next prove V⊆U\") and is what thm:exact-ratio-decoder consumes."
      }
    },
    "thm:exact-ratio-decoder": {
      "codex": {
        "verdict": "matched",
        "evidence_hash": "f6050c322b65398a7a93b4154f7298b79929e2d4",
        "note": "After unfolding all referenced definitions, the Lean statement matches the frozen theorem’s mechanism class, transitive-closure and rank recovery, intervention alignment, all-order parent containment and conditional-independence characterization, unique minimal pruning, compatible-representation uniqueness, and comparison/scope clauses; the world-family packaging is conservative because unused fibers impose no restrictions."
      },
      "claude": {
        "verdict": "matched",
        "evidence_hash": "f6050c322b65398a7a93b4154f7298b79929e2d4",
        "note": "Both directions check out: hypotheses = the paper's global assumptions (ass:positive-normalized-smooth-mechanisms, ass:causal-minimality, ass:shared-diffeomorphic-mixing, ass:one-perfect-intervention-per-node, ass:fixed-own-derivative-sign, all unfolded in Basic.lean) plus exactly membership in U_{G,s,π} (`coverSeparatedSet` = D_{ji}>0 on every permuted ancestral cover, matching def:cover-separated-set via θ ↦ canonicalObservedWorld with the world's own targetPerm), with faithfulness correctly absent from the main theorem and confined to the separate `exact_ratio_decoder_faithful` corollary as the frozen node's proof_tex prescribes; `ExactRatioDecoderConclusion` unfolds to the paper's clauses one-for-one — TransGen H_D = TransGen G^π, the U_i = Q_{π(i)}(v_{π(i)})/1−Q_{π(i)}(v_{π(i)}) rank identity keyed by s.value (π i) (SignVector.signed makes the `if =1 then/else` exhaustive) which also supplies the environment↔coordinate alignment, `environmentParentSet W i = π⁻¹(pa_G(π i)) ⊆ predecessorSet order i` for every topological ordering (injective ℕ labels = linear extension, so the B_i family is exactly the paper's), the P^0 conditional-independence iff for all A ⊆ B_i, unique inclusion-minimal admissible set with `(populationDecoder laws).2.2.edge = permutedGraph G W` and the ∀-order quantifier giving ordering-independence, componentwise-C² uniqueness against every compatible causal-minimal competitor with the same s and W'.law = W.law (support equality derived, not assumed), and the n=2 Gaussian-MMD edge positivity that yields the continuous law-separation witness; the extra conjuncts (`ObservedWorldLawCoherent`, the continuous-conditional-CDF-version clauses, the `j ≠ i` guard in `observedLawRatioGraph`, and the comparator scope/noncoverage payloads) are the law-only well-definedness and honest-scope content that def:population-decoder and the frozen statement's own comparison sentences already presuppose, so they neither weaken nor gerrymander the claim; the `world : ∀ θ', ObservedWorld G θ'` binder is a structural encoding artifact only (ObservedWorld is inhabited for every mechanism via canonicalObservedWorld, so the Π-form is interderivable with a single `W : ObservedWorld G θ` and introduces no vacuity), and the file elaborates with no errors."
      }
    },
    "thm:simultaneous-confidence-edges": {
      "codex": {
        "verdict": "matched",
        "evidence_hash": "50a914c89d624d283c121601f9355eb355f8b089",
        "note": "After unfolding all referenced definitions, Lean equivalently states the conditional and unconditional simultaneous MMD bounds, eventwise ancestral-edge soundness, and two-radius ancestral-cover margin recovery of the transitive closure."
      },
      "claude": {
        "verdict": "matched",
        "evidence_hash": "50a914c89d624d283c121601f9355eb355f8b089",
        "note": "Both directions check: `firstStageL1Event` = {∀ i,e: |R̂_i−R_i| integrable ∧ ∫|R̂_i−R_i| dP^e ≤ a_N} (the Integrable conjunct is the well-definedness the paper's E_{P^e}|·| presupposes; without it the Bochner integral would default to 0 and make the event trivially true, so it is the faithful — not a strengthened — rendering of max_{i,e}E_{P^e}|R̂_i−R_i|≤a_N), and hfirst is exactly Pr(E_N)≥1−η; `ConditionalProbabilityAtLeast μ (comap trainingFold) E A (1−α)` unfolds to (1−α)μ(A∩B) ≤ μ(E∩A∩B) for every training-measurable B, which (A itself being training-measurable by hSampling's last clause) is exactly Pr(A_N | training folds) ≥ 1−α a.s. on E_N; conjunct 2 is the unconditional 1−α−η; `simultaneousMmdEvent` = ∀ j≠i, |D̂_ji−D_ji| ≤ ε_N with `confidenceRadius` = 2√2·a_N + 2(1+√(2 log(n(n+1)/α)))/√(min_e N_e), matching the core's ε_N verbatim, and empirical/population discrepancies are the ‖μ̂_ij−μ̂_i0‖ / ‖μ_i0−μ_ij‖ Gaussian-kernel embeddings; conjunct 3 = 'every Ĥ-edge is ancestral in G^π' via G.isAncestor(π j, π i) on the event, matching proof_tex (38); conjunct 4 = (∀ π(j)⋖_G π(i): D_ji > 2ε_N) → TransGen Ĥ = TransGen(permutedGraph) = TC(G^π), the ∀-form being equivalent to the paper's min>2ε_N (vacuous both sides when no covers). Extra binders are all sanctioned: hpos/hmix/hone/hSampling are the node's own depends_on assumptions; hn : 1 ≤ n and hN : ∀e, 1 ≤ N_e are exactly the 'well-typed sampling domain' the frozen proof_tex declares for ε_N; hα/hη merely restate SampleSplitWorld.alpha_mem/eta_mem; the structure's ratioFit_pos matches the frozen symbol signature R̂_i : X → (0,∞) and ratioFit measurability is well-definedness, so 'arbitrary training-fold estimates' is not narrowed; the unused implicit {s : SignVector n} is logically inert (SignVector n is inhabited by value ≡ 1) and adds no restriction. File elaborates with no errors or sorry."
      }
    },
    "def:model-stratum": {
