      },
      "claude": {
        "verdict": "matched",
        "evidence_hash": "288407ca6ee6279dc1c563cf457244db006cf18b",
        "note": "Lean `{θ | ∀ j i, G.edge j i → secondMomentContrast (canonicalObservedWorld G θ.1 π) (π.symm j) (π.symm i) ≠ 0}` over `StratumPoint G s` is literally {θ∈Θ_{G,s} : F_{π⁻¹(j),π⁻¹(i)}(θ)≠0 for every edge j→i}; `secondMomentContrast W a b = ∫R_b² dP^{a+1} − ∫R_b² dP^0` matches the core's F_{ji}, and under `canonicalObservedWorld` label a indexes the intervention on latent π(a), so the composition with π.symm restores the paper's latent-edge indexing."
      }
    },
